-- A decision whose next slide has only a "Continue" on to a dead end was stored with dead_end false, since that slide is
-- not a dead end itself and the Continue is an advance, which is never stored. Jermain's Autumn and Spring Departures
-- and its Ramshackle Hut (cont.) slides are such slides, so "Leave in the autumn" or entering the hut counted as a correct
-- decision, and Consecutive Correct Decisions never reset for them. The server now stores such a decision as a dead end
-- (Slide.leadsToDeadEnd). This marks the ones stored before, by the path of the slide each led to: every such path in the
-- Jermain deck as of this migration. The Moses deck has none, so on its database this changes nothing.
UPDATE history.user_choices
SET dead_end = TRUE
WHERE NOT dead_end
  AND to_path_name IN (
    '/UGRR Scenario/START: Major Decision/Companion Decision/Decision: When to Go/Autumn Departure',
    '/UGRR Scenario/START: Major Decision/Companion Decision/Decision: When to Go/Spring Departure',
    '/UGRR Scenario/START: Major Decision/Companion Decision/Go To Old Ben/Autumn Departure',
    '/UGRR Scenario/START: Major Decision/Companion Decision/Ross Encounter, then Ben/Old Ben (via Ross): When to Go/Autumn Departure',
    '/UGRR Scenario/START: Major Decision/Companion Decision/Ross Encounter, then Ben/Old Ben (via Ross): When to Go/Spring Departure',
    '/UGRR Scenario/START: Major Decision/Companion Decision/Ross Encounter, then Ben/Old Ben (via Ross): When to Go/Steal an Overcoat (via Ross)/Major Encounter (via Ross): 1st Patrol/Major Encounter (via Ross): bluff 1st Patrol/Confident & Arrogant Bluff/First Town/Major Encounter: Baronial Mansion/Confident & Arrogant Bluff/Main Road out of First Town/Second Town/Major Encounter: Ordinary Tavern/Confident & Arrogant Bluff/Main Road out of Second Town/Third Town/Major Encounter: Ramshackle Hut/Major Encounter: Ramshackle Hut (cont.)',
    '/UGRR Scenario/START: Major Decision/Companion Decision/Ross Encounter, then Ben/Old Ben (via Ross): When to Go/Steal an Overcoat (via Ross)/Major Encounter (via Ross): 1st Patrol/Major Encounter (via Ross): bluff 1st Patrol/Confident & Arrogant Bluff/First Town/Major Encounter: Baronial Mansion/Confident & Arrogant Bluff/Main Road out of First Town/Second Town/Major Encounter: Ramshackle Hut/Major Encounter: Ramshackle Hut (cont.)',
